---
import FigureFrame from '../FigureFrame.astro';
// The Chosŏn interruption, drawn with its denominator. An empty stretch of axis says only that
// nobody looked; this figure shows what was looked at. Every mark is a record the project
// examined and excluded under its stated criteria, placed at the date the record itself carries,
// so a reader can see the bar being applied rather than take the zero on trust.
import timeline from '../../data/timeline.json';

type Mark = { id: string; label: string; start: number; end: number; scope: string; kind: string; lane: string; confidence: string };
const marks = timeline.marks as Mark[];

// Documented negatives whose dates fall wholly inside the window. Candidates without a safe date
// are never placed on an axis, here or anywhere else on this site; they are listed in the register.
const A = 1392, B = 1900;
const excluded = marks
  .filter((m) => m.scope === 'EXCLUDE' && m.start >= A && (m.end ?? m.start) <= B)
  .sort((a, b) => a.start - b.start);

const LAST_BEFORE = { year: 1370, label: "Dhyānabhadra's relics enshrined at Hoeamsa" };
const FIRST_AFTER = { year: 1981, label: 'A Korean Buddhist delegation to India' };
const GAP = FIRST_AFTER.year - LAST_BEFORE.year;

const Y0 = 1300, Y1 = 1990, X0 = 76, X1 = 926, AX = 150;
const x = (y: number) => X0 + ((y - Y0) / (Y1 - Y0)) * (X1 - X0);
const ticks = [1300, 1400, 1500, 1600, 1700, 1800, 1900];
const KIND = { lifeline: 'person', text: 'text', travel: 'journey', institution: 'institution', event: 'event' } as Record<string, string>;
---
<FigureFrame number="3 · The silence"
  title={`Five centuries in which every candidate examined failed the evidence bar`} id="silence" wide>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 1000 360" role="img"
    aria-label={`Timeline from 1300 to 1990. A hatched band covers 1392 to 1900, labelled zero carried records. ${excluded.length} excluded candidates are marked inside it: ${excluded.map((m) => `${m.label}, ${m.start}`).join('; ')}. The last carried record before the band is ${LAST_BEFORE.year} and the first after it is ${FIRST_AFTER.year}.`}>

    <defs>
      <pattern id="voidhatch" width="8" height="8" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(45)">
        <rect width="8" height="8" fill="var(--ground)" />
        <rect width="1.5" height="8" fill="var(--void)" />
      </pattern>
    </defs>

    <rect x={x(A)} y={AX - 34} width={x(B) - x(A)} height="68" fill="url(#voidhatch)" stroke="var(--void)" stroke-width="1" />
    <line x1={X0} y1={AX} x2={x(A)} y2={AX} stroke="var(--heading)" stroke-width="2" />
    <line x1={x(B)} y1={AX} x2={X1} y2={AX} stroke="var(--heading)" stroke-width="2" />
    <line x1={x(A)} y1={AX} x2={x(B)} y2={AX} stroke="var(--void)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="2 6" />

    <text x={(x(A) + x(B)) / 2} y={AX - 48} text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--f-title)" font-size="19" font-weight="700" fill="var(--heading)">
      0 carried records, 1392–1900
    </text>
    <text x={(x(A) + x(B)) / 2} y={AX - 70} text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--f-ui)" font-size="12.5" fill="var(--muted)">
      CHOSŎN
    </text>

    <circle cx={x(LAST_BEFORE.year)} cy={AX} r="6" fill="var(--b2)" />
    <text x={X0} y={AX - 58} font-family="var(--f-ui)" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">{LAST_BEFORE.year} · last carried record</text>
    <text x={X0} y={AX - 44} font-family="var(--f-ui)" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{LAST_BEFORE.label}</text>

    <circle cx={x(FIRST_AFTER.year)} cy={AX} r="6" fill="var(--b6)" />
    <text x={X1} y={AX - 58} text-anchor="end" font-family="var(--f-ui)" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">{FIRST_AFTER.year} · the next one</text>
    <text x={X1} y={AX - 44} text-anchor="end" font-family="var(--f-ui)" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{FIRST_AFTER.label}</text>

    {excluded.map((m, i) => {
      const cx = x(m.start);
      // Labels sit in evenly spaced slots joined by leaders, so six marks clustered in one
      // century cannot collide however the dates fall.
      const sx = X0 + (i + 0.5) * ((X1 - X0) / excluded.length);
      const ty = AX + 92;
      return (
        <>
          <path d={`M ${cx} ${AX + 14} L ${cx} ${AX + 46} L ${sx} ${ty - 34} L ${sx} ${ty - 22}`}
            fill="none" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="0.9" />
          <g stroke="var(--negative)" stroke-width="2">
            <line x1={cx - 5} y1={AX - 5} x2={cx + 5} y2={AX + 5} />
            <line x1={cx - 5} y1={AX + 5} x2={cx + 5} y2={AX - 5} />
          </g>
          <text x={sx} y={ty - 8} text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--f-body)" font-size="12.5" fill="var(--ink)">{m.label}</text>
          <text x={sx} y={ty + 8} text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--f-mono)" font-size="10.5" fill="var(--muted)">
            {m.start} · {KIND[m.kind] ?? m.kind}
          </text>
          <text x={sx} y={ty + 22} text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--f-ui)" font-size="10.5" fill="var(--negative)">
            examined, excluded
          </text>
        </>
      );
    })}

    <line x1={X0} y1="300" x2={X1} y2="300" stroke="var(--hairline)" />
    {ticks.map((t) => (
      <text x={x(t)} y="318" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--f-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t}</text>
    ))}
    <text x={X0} y="344" font-family="var(--f-ui)" font-size="12.5" fill="var(--muted)">
      {GAP} years between the last carried record and the next one
    </text>
  </svg>

  <div slot="caption">
    The most important number in this dataset is zero, and a zero is only worth anything if the
    search behind it is visible. The hatched band is the window; the crosses are records that were
    examined and did not meet the inclusion criteria, each at the date its own source gives. Chosŏn
    scholars who wrote about India from Chinese sources appear here rather than in the register:
    describing a place is not mediating an exchange with it, and the rule of collection is that no
    relationship is recorded as influential without documentary evidence. Candidates with no safe
    date are not placed on this axis at all; they are listed in the register as undated. The zero is
    a finding under stated criteria, not a claim that no contact ever occurred.
  </div>

  <div slot="table">
    <div class="tablewrap">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">Record</th><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col" class="num">Date</th><th scope="col">Outcome</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>{LAST_BEFORE.label}</td><td>event</td><td class="num">{LAST_BEFORE.year}</td><td>carried</td></tr>
          {excluded.map((m) => (
            <tr><td>{m.label}</td><td>{KIND[m.kind] ?? m.kind}</td><td class="num">{m.start}{m.end !== m.start ? `–${m.end}` : ''}</td><td>examined, excluded</td></tr>
          ))}
          <tr><td>{FIRST_AFTER.label}</td><td>event</td><td class="num">{FIRST_AFTER.year}</td><td>carried</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</FigureFrame>
